From 04ffcece5cf0af7a75a5be5082c6bd06ddae9188 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wzfs-ict <gjoshua@zhongshischool.org>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:56:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Certificates v2: watermark crest + bundled fonts (EB
 Garamond, Arizonia)

cert/crest-mark.png is the transparent watermark asset from the designer's final
package. cert/fonts/ bundles EB Garamond (400/400i/600/700 woff2) and Arizonia (TTF,
Tier 4 script names) so certificates.html loads no fonts from the internet and prints
the same in China.
---
 cert/crest-mark.png                     | Bin 0 -> 139653 bytes
 cert/fonts/arizonia.ttf                 | Bin 0 -> 125088 bytes
 cert/fonts/eb-garamond-400-italic.woff2 | Bin 0 -> 25388 bytes
 cert/fonts/eb-garamond-400.woff2        | Bin 0 -> 44336 bytes
 cert/fonts/eb-garamond-600.woff2        | Bin 0 -> 44336 bytes
 cert/fonts/eb-garamond-700.woff2        | Bin 0 -> 44336 bytes
 6 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 cert/crest-mark.png
 create mode 100644 cert/fonts/arizonia.ttf
 create mode 100644 cert/fonts/eb-garamond-400-italic.woff2
 create mode 100644 cert/fonts/eb-garamond-400.woff2
 create mode 100644 cert/fonts/eb-garamond-600.woff2
 create mode 100644 cert/fonts/eb-garamond-700.woff2

diff --git a/cert/crest-mark.png b/cert/crest-mark.png
new file mode 100644
